.TH SAMPLE 1 "" "zstaller sample" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sample \- the zstaller sample program
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sample
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sample
prints its version, the platform it was built for and where it is
installed. It shows how zstaller packages a Zig program; see
.BR sample-tool (1)
for the second program in the package.
